  sig=func (a *API) Impact(id string, maxDepth int) string
  doc=Impact returns the affected NODE set for id: the reverse-edge transitive\nclosure over calls, references, and implements. The root id is excluded (it\nis what changed; the fragment lists what it would break). maxDepth <= 0 or\nbeyond MaxImpactDepth clamps to MaxImpactDepth. The result is a compact .kvx\nfragment of ids/locations/summaries — never raw source.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/codegraph/retrieve.API
  ^defines=matrix/codegraph/retrieve/retrieve.go

