  sig=func (a *API) Neighbors(id string, edge model.EdgeType, dir model.Direction, depth int) (string, error)
  doc=Neighbors returns a bounded subgraph around id over edge type edge (or all\ntypes when edge == "") in the given direction, to at most MaxDepth. Depth\nbeyond MaxDepth is rejected rather than expanded.
